Special instructions:
- On my MINIX setup, I built the driver in /usr/src/drivers/secrets.
- Build the ioctl test with: cc -o grant_secret grant_secret.c
- Run grant_secret with the UID to grant to, ex: ./grant_secret 13

Changes made outside the driver:
(mostly just followed the pdf)
- Added the secret service to /etc/system.conf.
- Created /dev/Secret with major 20 and minor 0.
- Added ioc_secret.h for the SSGRANT ioctl.
- Included ioc_secret.h from sys/ioctl.h.
- Copied the ioctl header changes into /usr/include/sys/.

Other notes:
- DEBUG_ENABLED defaults to 0.
- Assignment4Screenshots.pdf shows the driver working in MINIX.
